# Window switcher: hold super, Tab twice, release commits; Esc cancels.
key super+shift+Return
wait-toplevel foot 4000
drag 300 27 500 127
key super+shift+Return
sleep 800
drag 300 27 600 227
key super+shift+Return
sleep 800
spawn sleep 0.7; grim -c $OUT/00-switcher-open.png
keydown super ; key Tab ; key Tab ; sleep 1200 ; keyup super
shot 01-after-commit
keydown super ; key Tab ; sleep 300 ; key Escape ; keyup super
shot 02-after-cancel
